Package: fastMethyl
Title: Fast, Parallel Preprocessing of Illumina Methylation Arrays
Version: 2026.0.6172046
Authors@R:
    person("Sebastian", "Hoß", email = "seb@xn--ho-hia.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A performance layer over minfi and bigmelon for large Illumina
    methylation cohorts. Provides parallel IDAT reading with an integer-indexed
    worker assembly hot path, and a fused per-sample streaming pipeline that
    runs read + detection p-value + raw preprocessing + sample/probe quality
    control in a single pass, writing an LZ4_RA-compressed, bigmelon-compatible
    GDS file. The runPreprocess() entry point validates every input
    up front and emits a QC'd GDS ready for downstream normalization and
    analysis.
License: Artistic-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/sebhoss/fastMethyl
